To connect to PostgreSQL:

Launch pgAdmin4 from the desktop icon
Click "Add New Server"
Fill in:
Name: LocalPostgreSQL (or any name)
Host: localhost
Port: 5432
Username: postgres
Password: (leave blank if no password is set)
Database: testdb
Click Save


systemctl status postgresql

